\strike \strikec0 Compass always seems to point around 130-140 degrees but I opened the iphone compass app and it pointed north correctly so it is a problem with this code. True north just shows a hyphen. Slider bar for single point bearing uncertainty should be labeled as such and should show the number of degrees currently set for the user as a number not just with the wedge in the compass. Bubble level should move around like a real bubble in a bubble level and then turn green when it is in the correct orientation. Compass numbers and letter labels overlap with the tick marks. Move the labels a little bit in radially so they don\'92t overlap the ticks. The save bearing button is always greyed out. Can you make the compass look similar to the iPhone compass app compass but with two triangles (magnetic north and true north (light red) - the uncertainty wedge should just show around the pointing direction of the phone. I\'92m pasting an image of the iPhone app now. \strike0\striked0 \
\
\strike \strikec0 The Compass tool and the bearing capture in the record menu seem to be redundant. The bearing edit tool needs a reset or clear button that eliminates/resets the measurement in case the user wants to do it again. Why is there a save bearing option in the compass if there is no tag selected. The compass tool shouldn\'92t have any save options. That should be reserved for the \'91record\'92 bearing screen. Make sure the record bearing compass mirrors the compass display. They are different now. The compass tool highlights a red ring of the deviation from north. That shouldn\'92t be there. The small red triangle at the outer radius of the compass is good but it isn\'92t clear if that is true or magnetic north. Make it clear. When a user selects a range capture and then hits start the angular band they select should be highlighted as they move the compass so that when they hit end, the range they selected is highlighted and center of that band is indicated as the bearing. Be sure to fix the record bearing compass as discussed.\
\
The undo bar on the deleted projects doesn\'92t ever go away. This might be the same with other actions with an undo. Check them and make sure they eventually go away after 6 seconds. \
\
Triangulation time window should be a text edit not a +/- time\strike0\striked0 \
\
\strike \strikec0 Need a branded splash screen and the corrected app icon\strike0\striked0 \
