Can you keep the phone from locking when downloading so that the downloads continue or does it continue to download when locked? Also add and estimated time remaining based on the current download rate? Also, the green progress bars always show 100% and don\'92t move during the download but the fraction of downloads show (ie 512/3000). Fix the progress bars. \
\
\strike \strikec0 In the measurement tool, the user should be able to move the positions of the end of the line after it is initially selected and the measurement should update. There should be a \'91Clear\'92 button to remove the line and make a new one. When the line is added, a small graph at the bottom of the map should display the elevation profile between the two points. The extent of the graph on the screen should start at about 20% of the screen hight but the user should be able to increase or decrease the height extend or swipe it down to hide it. \
